This project ports designs and, in later stages, code from the following
open-source projects. Attribution is recorded here per the implementation
plan (section 12); entries marked "planned" are not yet in the tree.

huggingface/speech-to-speech (Apache-2.0)
  Realtime protocol conventions used as a reference spec; the generation
  invalidation semantics (design of pipeline/cancel_scope.py); the event
  injection pattern; normalize_realtime_url and its reconnect timeouts
  (planned). The upstream checkout is never vendored or modified: runtime
  patches live in tools/s2s_shim/ and are injected via PYTHONPATH.

QwenAudio/qwen-audio-agent (Apache-2.0)
  AnnouncementWindow (speaking-floor gate), batch-and-receipt delivery,
  the Provider/Protocol/Capabilities split, the serial command queue
  (planned for stage 1-2).

liliMozi/openhanako (Apache-2.0)
  Persona layering with fallback chain, SQLite fact store, the MoodParser
  incremental tag state machine (planned for stage 4-5). The hanako, ming and
  butter persona texts under config/personas/ are ported verbatim from its
  identity/ishiki templates; their proactive prompts adapt its yuan scaffolds.

Project-N-E-K-O/N.E.K.O (Apache-2.0)
  Danmaku scoring order (guard > admin > medal > level > length,
  livedanmaku.py:477, renormalised to 0..1), the windowed pick-one
  selection, the paid-event lane, and the safety values our components
  reuse: 0.35s dedup window, 60s per-uid cooldown, 3-failures/60s
  breaker, 1.0s combo settle with 600s suppression (landed 2026-08-13).

Open-LLM-VTuber (MIT)
  sentence_divider (CJK chunking), tts_manager ordered delivery,
  interruption memory rewrite (planned for stage 5).

xfgryujk/blivedm (MIT)
  Bilibili live protocol client, vendored unmodified at
  src/bilisama/ingest/bilibili/_vendor/blivedm/ with its LICENSE preserved.
  dev branch @ 0da0c10fc50ed0ccd3e68c65f6a503cf3ca4198b, vendored 2026-08-13;
  provenance and re-vendor steps in that directory's VENDOR.md.

Live2D Cubism Core (proprietary, "Redistributable Code")
  To be redistributed unmodified with its copyright header intact and a
  separate LICENSE-Live2D.md (planned for stage 6; commercial gate
  documented in docs/live2d-licensing.md).
